      "value": "If the torso followed after the head turns at a 90 degree angle of left or right instead of of its current sensativity (30 degrees?) Then it would allow more headmovement before the torso follows. Not looking for a disable button so much as simply asking they change the angle setting to allow the head 90 degree turn instead before torso follows. If they make it a BUTTON then it might cause problems cause now if its OFF then yes you can turn your head but now you gotta go through extra effort to make the body turn around with you. Just change its sensetivity devs, please, thats all it would take.",
